abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and frozen causal30_v1 reproducibility package for a
  physics-informed multimodal graph neural network for spatio-temporal
  glacier-lake instability and GLOF hazard forecasting at Shisper Glacier.
  The archived version contains the chronological protocol, compact evidence,
  verification scripts, reproduced tables and figures, and explicit scientific
  interpretation boundaries.
